  "resource_review": {
    "core": 0,
    "assumptions": [
      "Selected example examples/PyControlLinkQp, PlatformIO environment mouse_joystick_qp_rev2, generic RP2040, framework-arduinopico 1.40200.0; no extra command-line/environment build overrides.",
      "QS_ON enabled, MJ_BOARD_REV=2; MJ_LINK_USB=0, MJ_SIM_MOTION=0 and MJ_TICK_PROBE=0 defaults from Bsp.cpp. QV on core 0; no setup1/loop1 or FreeRTOS.",
      "Arduino bundled USB path: NO_USB, USE_TINYUSB, DISABLE_USB_SERIAL and DEBUG_RP2040_PORT are not defined. Serial is USB CDC; Serial1 UART0 is configured by the application.",
      "SDK default hardware alarm 3 is enabled. Reviewed installed RP2040 libpico.a disassembly of runtime_init_default_alarm_pool confirms alarm 3 and 16 software timer slots; archive is hashed below.",
      "sdk_startup is the conservative union of SDK/Arduino startup reservations, retained through boot and runtime. Boot pin coverage remains limited to the beacon, not all initialization writes.",
      "No DMA channel claims in the selected synchronous SPI/I2C/ADC, SerialUART RX or transmit-only SerialPIO paths. An empty resources array means none in this reviewed subset, not unused silicon.",
      "Generic variant defines default LED/UART pins, but main/initVariant do not initialize a GPIO LED or default hardware UART in this configuration. USB CDC startup does not claim UART0 GP0/GP1."
    ],
    "excluded": [
      "Not whole-program C++/preprocessor/linker inference. New source files, dependencies, build overrides and alternate environments require a fresh review even when the recorded hashes match.",
      "Software timer-slot occupancy (USB plus delay/sleep callers), spinlocks, DMA DREQ/pacing, RAM, clocks, flash/boot ROM, interrupt priorities/latency and multicore vector-table behavior are not budgeted.",
      "No runtime allocator assignment, deployed-image identity, loss/throughput, reset/off-state, electrical or physical debug qualification."
    ]
  },
  "resource_coverage": "selected-reviewed-consumers",
  "limits": [
    "Subset for SIO, SPI, UART, I2C, external ADC and PIO; no PWM/clock/USB alternate-function model.",
    "Resource subset: exclusive core-0 IRQ handlers, DMA channels, hardware alarms with IRQs, SysTick and watchdog. USER_IRQ_26 through USER_IRQ_31 name the six software-only NVIC slots.",
    "Static declared ownership only; shared-handler clients must be grouped under one owner. No multicore vector-table, software alarm-slot, priority, clock, initialization or electrical qualification.",
    "Firmware functions are reviewed declarations; source hashes detect drift, not semantic correctness.",
    "Compile BoardPins against the same hardware export separately; this checker does not parse C++.",
    "PIO placement is a static capacity witness, not proof of runtime availability or program timing.",
    "Only full_coverage_phases require every bound pin; resource coverage is explicitly scoped by resource_review.",
    "Resource witnesses cover declared exclusive owners on core 0, not actual allocator choices, IRQ latency or runtime availability.",
    "No reset/off-state electrical, firmware deployment or timing qualification is implied."
  ],
